From: XR1710G local merge
Subject: [PATCH] mt7996: port B12 stock ADC thermal policy and coherent cache to mt76 0936617d

Consolidates former local patches 135-138 on the new driver. Preserve
upstream beacon/SCS/MSCS capabilities and command/response validation.

--- a/mt7996/init.c
+++ b/mt7996/init.c
